Craig Watson (23 Oct, about 3:15 pm AWST): any Navision / import line whose description or operation code contains MMT seat covers, IVMS, RADLINK or reflective stripes is an external Sublet. It is never Fitting, Electrical, Bus or another workshop station.

Matching is the whole operation line (description and operation code), not a GP PO item on another line.
- MMT seat covers: MMT … SEAT COVER or SEAT COVERS, any case. "Canvas seat covers" does not match.
- IVMS and RADLINK: the word on its own. DIVMS does not match.
- Reflective stripes: those two words after spaces are collapsed, any case. "reflective striping" does not match.

The six category bodies stay at the r523 checksums. They already call note_fee_sublet_521 before the department gate, before UNALLOCATED, before saved ai routing, and again after the department 138 station overwrite. This preview extends that hook's regex. It does not create a separate helper and it does not replace those six functions. The before_import_rules_20261017 pin stays release r523 and md5 82c809d15c382e73c0ae5bf135293ebe, so bus_whole_job_450 stays green.

