Work-item writes are the sublet key only, recorded in pdc_ops.named_external_work_touch_584. The down file restores those rows. Inserted rows are deleted only while pdc_772_work_item_no_delete is disabled, and that trigger is enabled again before the down file finishes. Pin count stays 241. No new pin.

